# A future docs image builds from the repository root (apps/docs/Dockerfile), as Fuse's does. Keep
# host installs and build output out of the context so the image compiles everything itself.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.output
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.artifacts
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.agents
.claude
.ref
.scratch
.pnpm-store
.env
**/.DS_Store
